---
import Museum from "../layouts/Museum.astro";
---

<Museum title="About" description="The story of Ethan's Museum of Cool Science, then and now.">
  <h1>About the museum</h1>

  <div class="lcars-text-bar"><h2>The original museum</h2></div>
  <p>
    When I was a kid I collected everything: coins, toys, rocks and stones, pennies, and especially pressed pennies. I
    put them on display and called it <strong>Ethan's Museum of Cool Science</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    The collections have changed since then. Now there are Nintendo consoles and cartridges, Star Trek memorabilia,
    comic books, Pokémon cards, DVDs, and books, and the pressed pennies never left. Not all of it is science anymore,
    but the name stays. It's the original, and I don't want to forget it.
  </p>

  <div class="lcars-text-bar"><h2>How the museum works</h2></div>
  <p>
    The museum has one lobby and a wing for each collection. No collection here is complete or exhaustive, and none is
    trying to be. Each one is a snapshot of what I've picked up, been given, or held onto.
  </p>

  <div class="lcars-text-bar" id="not-for-sale"><h2>Not for sale</h2></div>
  <p>
    Every exhibit is part of my personal collection. <strong>Nothing here is for sale or trade</strong>, and I won't
    answer offers. Happy to talk about the stuff itself, though.
  </p>
</Museum>
